  "annotations": [
    {
      "id": "a-light",
      "page": "page-1",
      "x": -320,
      "y": 40,
      "w": 240,
      "text": "A \u2014 Lavender glass, light\n\nGlassmorphic cards on a lavender gradient, 3D gradient spheres, near-black floating nav.\nSchibsted Grotesk + Manrope."
    },
    {
      "id": "a-dark",
      "page": "page-1",
      "x": -320,
      "y": 1040,
      "w": 240,
      "text": "A \u2014 Lavender glass, dark\n\nDeep plum ground; glass panels drop to 6\u201310% white, the jewel spheres carry unchanged, near-black chips invert to light.\nAccent lifts to #B18BE0."
    },
    {
      "id": "b-light",
      "page": "page-1",
      "x": -320,
      "y": 2040,
      "w": 240,
      "text": "B \u2014 Trippin blue, light\n\nWhite cards on pale blue, flat vector illustration, gradient pill buttons, navy pill nav.\nArchivo (Helvetica Now stand-in)."
    },
    {
      "id": "b-dark",
      "page": "page-1",
      "x": -320,
      "y": 3040,
      "w": 240,
      "text": "B \u2014 Trippin blue, dark\n\nMidnight Blue taken all the way down (#0B111F ground, #141D31 cards). Blue Ribbon and Persimmon unchanged."
    },
    {
      "id": "vox-note",
      "page": "page-2",
      "x": -320,
      "y": 40,
      "w": 240,
      "text": "Voxel art\n\nSame two themes, same layouts \u2014 only the imagery changes.\n\nIsometric cubes on a 2:1 projection, three face shades per colour (top 1.16, right 0.86, left 0.64), each object on a square tray tile.\n\nModels are generated from a voxel grid, so bowl / apple / glass stay consistent at every size."
    },
    {
      "id": "vox-a-dark",
      "page": "page-2",
      "x": -320,
      "y": 1040,
      "w": 240,
      "text": "A voxel, dark\n\nThe voxel palette is self-lit, so the models carry into dark untouched \u2014 only the ground and chrome are remapped."
    },
    {
      "id": "vox-b",
      "page": "page-2",
      "x": -320,
      "y": 2040,
      "w": 240,
      "text": "B voxel\n\nModels re-keyed to Blue Ribbon and Persimmon. The flat-vector still-life, the top-down bowl and the card thumbnails are all replaced."
    },
    {
      "id": "set-aside",
      "page": "page-3",
      "x": -320,
      "y": 40,
      "w": 240,
      "text": "Set aside\n\nC \u2014 Cargo dark (Outfit, lemon yellow)\nD \u2014 Industrial light (Instrument Serif, amber)\nE \u2014 Playful pastel (Poppins, four pastels)\n\nKept for reference; not carried into dark mode or voxel."
    }
  ],
